WEBVTT

00:02.127 --> 00:04.671
WRITTEN BY HYUGA NATSU

01:33.885 --> 01:34.928
Lady Gyokuyou,

01:35.011 --> 01:38.306
what do you mean Maomao hasn’t come back?

01:38.389 --> 01:40.350
From the look of it,

01:40.433 --> 01:43.561
it seems like you didn’t sneak her out.

01:43.645 --> 01:45.063
I would not do that.

01:46.022 --> 01:49.359
Has she gotten herself involved
in something troublesome again?

01:50.318 --> 01:53.822
Hongniang, when did you last see her?

01:54.405 --> 01:56.908
She was here yesterday during the day.

01:57.450 --> 01:59.452
She was apparently preparing mugwort

01:59.536 --> 02:01.830
for Lady Gyokuyou in the medical office.

02:02.789 --> 02:05.708
<i>At that time,
they apparently discussed making a notice</i>

02:05.792 --> 02:07.502
<i>to post in the rear palace.</i>

02:07.585 --> 02:09.212
<i>After that,</i>

02:09.295 --> 02:11.840
<i>she went to the study hall.</i>

02:11.923 --> 02:13.800
I searched everywhere

02:13.883 --> 02:15.718
she might have gone,

02:15.802 --> 02:17.637
but I couldn’t find her.

02:19.472 --> 02:21.975
<i>She may act impulsively sometimes,</i>

02:22.058 --> 02:23.893
<i>but she knows abandoning her post</i>

02:23.977 --> 02:27.730
<i>as Lady Gyokuyou's attendant
would lead to punishment.</i>

02:28.481 --> 02:30.692
<i>Unless... she can’t return.</i>

02:30.775 --> 02:33.820
<i>Or perhaps she got caught up in something.</i>

02:33.903 --> 02:36.322
Did she make any enemies?

02:36.406 --> 02:38.032
If it's enemies,

02:38.116 --> 02:40.535
she most likely made them here and there.

02:46.457 --> 02:48.126
Even Maomao

02:48.209 --> 02:51.212
wouldn’t stand a chance
if she was ganged up on.

02:51.296 --> 02:53.131
Yes. However...

02:53.923 --> 02:56.384
Xiaomao wouldn’t go down so easily

02:56.467 --> 02:58.344
without taking someone down with her.

03:00.972 --> 03:03.099
<i>If she stays gone with no explanation,</i>

03:03.182 --> 03:05.351
<i>we’ll have no choice but to punish her.</i>

03:05.435 --> 03:09.188
<i>But before that, we must find her.</i>

03:10.648 --> 03:11.566
Excuse me.

03:12.609 --> 03:14.569
Oh, Lord Jinshi, I was just preparing tea...

03:14.652 --> 03:15.528
No need.

03:16.279 --> 03:17.822
Rather, I have questions for you.

03:18.406 --> 03:20.241
About Maomao, right?

03:20.325 --> 03:24.370
Yes. Tell me everything that happened
before she vanished.

03:25.455 --> 03:26.581
Yes.

03:28.917 --> 03:30.418
That’s all I know.

03:31.586 --> 03:33.379
<i>She made mugwort in the medical office,</i>

03:33.463 --> 03:35.882
<i>then went to the study hall.</i>

03:36.716 --> 03:40.011
<i>I can't get more than what I already heard
at the Jade Palace.</i>

03:44.140 --> 03:47.143
Now that I think about it,
is Maomao not around today?

03:47.227 --> 03:48.645
MAOMAO

03:48.728 --> 03:52.649
Speaking of her,
when the young lady left here,

03:52.732 --> 03:54.484
she was oddly clingy.

03:59.447 --> 04:01.032
What was she like?

04:02.200 --> 04:05.912
I think it was when
you went to the toilet, Mr. Luomen.

04:05.995 --> 04:08.414
She was a bit too clingy
for just being playful.

04:08.498 --> 04:11.501
I think it was
after she took out some medicine

04:11.584 --> 04:13.753
that helps with fatigue.

04:26.266 --> 04:28.518
What's wrong, Mr. Luomen?

04:30.103 --> 04:32.689
Is this what she took?

04:35.066 --> 04:37.485
I don’t remember that well,

04:37.568 --> 04:40.655
but I feel like there used to be more.

04:42.156 --> 04:43.950
I’m sorry,

04:44.033 --> 04:46.661
but may I go look for her?

04:47.537 --> 04:48.705
Do you know where she is?

04:48.788 --> 04:52.166
No, I mean the cat Maomao.

04:52.250 --> 04:54.669
Though I might find the girl too.

05:02.093 --> 05:04.804
How will finding the cat help?

05:05.388 --> 05:06.639
I don't know...

05:13.187 --> 05:16.024
It’s a new medicine, strong in aroma,

05:16.107 --> 05:17.608
and very effective.

05:19.652 --> 05:24.532
Maomao, where are you? Meow!

05:25.742 --> 05:27.744
<i>Let’s pretend we didn’t hear that.</i>

05:28.911 --> 05:30.913
A cat’s range

05:30.997 --> 05:33.499
isn't usually that extensive.

05:33.583 --> 05:35.960
Lord Jinshi, we’ve found her.

05:36.044 --> 05:38.379
- Where?
- In the thickets on the north side.

05:40.715 --> 05:44.343
She’s either sleeping... or drunk.

05:47.388 --> 05:48.681
These berries...

05:49.182 --> 05:52.226
They match the ones I brought earlier.

05:53.061 --> 05:55.229
There’s also this, and...

05:55.313 --> 05:56.481
Paper?

06:00.318 --> 06:01.944
There’s nothing written on it...

06:02.028 --> 06:05.448
Maomao probably left it.

06:05.531 --> 06:08.284
But if it’s blank,
what was she trying to say?

06:08.367 --> 06:11.662
We might understand
if we return to the medical office.

06:13.331 --> 06:15.750
<i>He won't say anything until there's proof.</i>

06:16.626 --> 06:18.920
<i>So Maomao took after
her adoptive father, huh?</i>

06:20.505 --> 06:23.591
This may look like a blank piece of paper,

06:23.674 --> 06:27.386
but she used to enjoy
this little game as a child.

06:30.681 --> 06:31.641
The writing...

06:32.141 --> 06:35.103
If you write on paper using juice or tea,

06:35.186 --> 06:39.315
only that part burns more easily
when it's heated.

06:40.525 --> 06:43.111
This time, she used alcohol.

06:44.195 --> 06:47.865
Ah, now that you mention it,
she did take a few bottles of alcohol.

06:48.616 --> 06:50.868
<i>You could’ve said that first.</i>

06:50.952 --> 06:55.206
Why was the cat Maomao sleeping there?

06:55.748 --> 06:57.750
This is called catnip.

06:57.834 --> 06:59.544
When brewed into tea,

06:59.627 --> 07:02.755
it helps relieve poor circulation
and fatigue.

07:02.839 --> 07:06.759
Cats love it. It makes them act drunk.

07:06.843 --> 07:09.137
She likely used the cat as a marker,

07:09.220 --> 07:11.347
and used it.

07:11.431 --> 07:13.850
Although the odds of finding it are low,

07:13.933 --> 07:17.645
she probably hoped Luomen would notice.

07:18.646 --> 07:21.190
One character is "shrine,"

07:21.941 --> 07:23.943
but I can’t read the other one.

07:24.527 --> 07:27.530
Is there a shrine near that area?

07:27.613 --> 07:31.200
There’s an old building
north of the rear palace.

07:31.284 --> 07:32.118
Let's send someone.

07:33.244 --> 07:34.871
The other character...

07:34.954 --> 07:38.916
What is it? It looks hastily scribbled,
like there wasn’t time.

07:40.293 --> 07:42.837
Was she in a desperate situation?

07:45.798 --> 07:47.175
Well, who knows?

07:48.426 --> 07:49.927
Aren’t you worried?

07:50.011 --> 07:52.763
I'm worried. However...

07:52.847 --> 07:56.350
all I can do is what I’m able to do.

07:56.434 --> 08:00.146
I can’t let this
interfere with my other duties.

08:00.229 --> 08:03.858
Plus, she was out of contact

08:03.941 --> 08:05.401
for nearly a year once before.

08:07.862 --> 08:10.239
<i>Right after she was taken,</i>

08:10.323 --> 08:12.241
<i>she couldn’t even reach her family</i>

08:12.325 --> 08:14.869
<i>and just worked silently as a maid.</i>

08:17.246 --> 08:19.916
<i>These two are similar...</i>

08:21.167 --> 08:24.253
<i>I will do the same. I’ll do what I can.</i>

08:24.921 --> 08:26.172
Excuse me.

08:36.807 --> 08:37.892
Lord Jinshi!

08:48.361 --> 08:50.154
<i>I must carry myself as a noble.</i>

08:50.863 --> 08:52.240
<i>I will do what I can.</i>

08:53.199 --> 08:55.117
<i>Right now, as a eunuch,</i>

08:55.618 --> 08:57.578
<i>my duty is to track Maomao down.</i>

08:59.455 --> 09:01.374
It's messy handwriting...

09:01.457 --> 09:04.794
More than messy. it looks rushed,

09:04.877 --> 09:07.380
as if she couldn’t write properly.

09:07.964 --> 09:10.132
It sort of looks like
the character for "wing."

09:10.216 --> 09:13.219
But the lower part is quite neat.

09:13.928 --> 09:16.764
Mao Mao’s writing has a quirk to it.

09:17.640 --> 09:19.016
Everyone, take a look.

09:19.642 --> 09:21.978
Isn't this the character for "next"?

09:23.145 --> 09:25.273
It’s similar, but something feels off.

09:25.356 --> 09:27.775
Yeah, there are more strokes.

09:27.858 --> 09:30.903
I agree, Sister.

09:30.987 --> 09:32.905
What do you think, Seki-u?

09:34.240 --> 09:37.535
Doesn’t it look like
the character for "green"?

09:37.618 --> 09:40.621
Look here. It looks warped
but it’s actually straight.

09:40.705 --> 09:44.458
You're right. Green because this is
the Jade Palace?

09:44.542 --> 09:46.335
I wonder what she meant by it.

09:47.336 --> 09:48.879
Shisui.

09:52.341 --> 09:53.551
Who’s that?

09:54.760 --> 09:58.764
Um, it’s the name of a maid
who’s often seen with Maomao.

09:58.848 --> 09:59.932
She’s called Shisui...

10:00.766 --> 10:02.059
<i>A name, huh...</i>

10:02.560 --> 10:05.938
<i>There’s another maid
whose name also includes "Sui."</i>

10:06.606 --> 10:09.609
There’s also one called Shaoran,

10:09.692 --> 10:11.360
and they often hung out together.

10:11.444 --> 10:14.280
I’ve met that maid a few times.

10:14.363 --> 10:16.907
But the other one vanished...

10:19.619 --> 10:21.078
Find the maid named Shisui.

10:21.162 --> 10:22.121
Yes!

10:25.291 --> 10:26.250
Lord Jinshi.

10:45.519 --> 10:47.647
<i>We’re drifting...</i>

10:48.272 --> 10:50.066
I wonder where we’re headed.

10:50.149 --> 10:51.484
Who knows?

10:57.490 --> 11:00.368
If you want to save this girl, obey.

11:01.243 --> 11:04.622
<i>Back then, I had no choice
but to follow Suirei.</i>

11:04.705 --> 11:08.292
<i>If I had refused, both Shisui and I
would’ve been in danger.</i>

11:09.543 --> 11:12.129
I wasn't tempted by
the medicine to revive the dead.

11:12.213 --> 11:13.464
Huh? What?

11:13.547 --> 11:17.426
<i>Still, who knew there was such
a hidden passage in the rear palace?</i>

11:20.346 --> 11:22.723
Don’t even think of calling for help.

11:24.725 --> 11:25.893
<i>This place...</i>

11:26.560 --> 11:29.188
<i>is near where I first met Shisui.</i>

11:29.271 --> 11:32.775
- Shenlü, keep watch.
- Yes.

11:44.245 --> 11:46.247
All right. Let’s go.

11:47.998 --> 11:51.377
<i>I hope my father realizes what’s going on.</i>

11:59.677 --> 12:02.096
A carriage is waiting outside.

12:02.680 --> 12:06.475
From here on, you’ll play the part
of a village girl who has been sold off.

12:06.559 --> 12:09.145
Change clothes there,
and we’ll head to the port.

12:13.983 --> 12:18.070
<i>When I changed,
the alcohol was discovered.</i>

12:18.154 --> 12:20.114
<i>The only thing I managed to keep on me</i>

12:20.197 --> 12:23.617
<i>was the hairpin Lord Jinshi gave me.</i>

12:25.953 --> 12:29.832
<i>Should I make plans to escape with Shisui?</i>

12:30.708 --> 12:31.792
<i>No.</i>

12:36.005 --> 12:38.424
- You'll go to sleep?
- Yeah.

12:39.467 --> 12:40.384
Me too.

12:44.305 --> 12:47.349
<i>She’s usually so loud and cheerful,
like a kid.</i>

12:54.857 --> 12:57.401
Good night, Maomao.

12:58.402 --> 13:00.654
Good night, Shisui.

13:12.791 --> 13:14.877
We'll walk a bit further now.

13:20.049 --> 13:22.384
<i>We had to switch boats twice.</i>

13:22.468 --> 13:24.595
<i>We were on the river...</i>

13:25.304 --> 13:27.473
<i>Are these guys the guards?</i>

13:28.474 --> 13:29.934
<i>Something’s off.</i>

13:30.017 --> 13:33.521
<i>When we were on the boat,
I thought we were heading north,</i>

13:33.604 --> 13:35.773
<i>but this forest</i>

13:35.856 --> 13:37.733
<i>is warm and humid.</i>

13:38.734 --> 13:41.237
<i>Where could this be?</i>

13:41.320 --> 13:44.156
<i>I wonder if there are
any unusual plants growing here.</i>

13:52.289 --> 13:53.874
<i>What was that?</i>

13:54.458 --> 13:57.378
<i>A snake? Afraid of snakes?</i>

13:58.587 --> 14:00.631
<i>That’s not so strange.</i>

14:01.215 --> 14:02.800
<i>What is strange is...</i>

14:23.112 --> 14:25.447
It's okay. They're not here anymore.

14:28.951 --> 14:30.286
<i>This is bad.</i>

14:33.080 --> 14:35.958
Slowly breathe in... and out.

14:36.041 --> 14:38.168
Hey, you!

14:39.044 --> 14:40.421
<i>This confirms it.</i>

14:43.549 --> 14:45.718
What are you trying to pull?

14:46.302 --> 14:47.720
Just some petty harassment.

14:47.803 --> 14:50.431
It didn’t seem like that was all...

14:53.267 --> 14:56.937
Suirei, you knew Shisui
before this, didn’t you?

14:59.023 --> 15:00.983
What are you talking about?

15:01.066 --> 15:05.821
Shisui seems far more educated
than she looks.

15:06.488 --> 15:09.992
<i>And her manners here and there
gave away her privileged upbringing.</i>

15:10.075 --> 15:11.076
A bug!

15:11.160 --> 15:14.204
<i>Although it's true
that she didn’t always act that way.</i>

15:14.788 --> 15:17.416
There are plenty of maids like that.

15:17.499 --> 15:21.086
After all, even the strategist
has a daughter.

15:21.170 --> 15:24.298
<i>Seems like they've looked into me too...</i>

15:24.381 --> 15:25.633
Shisui,

15:25.716 --> 15:29.345
you must’ve been shocked when that kitten
appeared from the secret passage.

15:32.097 --> 15:34.099
<i>You panicked and chased her,</i>

15:34.183 --> 15:36.185
<i>only to be seen by someone.</i>

15:42.983 --> 15:47.112
Maomao, you are sharp.
That's why you set me up, huh?

15:47.196 --> 15:48.489
But don't do that again.

15:48.572 --> 15:50.866
My older sister hates snakes.

15:51.450 --> 15:53.827
Didn’t I say the name was too obvious?

15:53.911 --> 15:56.705
The others didn’t catch on though.

15:58.415 --> 16:02.211
<i>Suirei and Shisui
only differ by one character.</i>

16:02.294 --> 16:04.505
<i>Most maids can’t read,</i>

16:04.588 --> 16:06.590
<i>so they didn’t notice.</i>

16:07.091 --> 16:10.135
<i>But that solves one mystery.</i>

16:10.719 --> 16:13.514
<i>How did Maomao get in?</i>

16:13.597 --> 16:17.768
<i>Shisui was visiting
the bath around that time.</i>

16:17.851 --> 16:20.854
<i>Probably to help her get in contact with
Suirei more easily while she</i>

16:20.938 --> 16:23.399
<i>worked as a eunuch, transporting water.</i>

16:24.775 --> 16:26.402
Maybe I’ve failed as a spy.

16:27.486 --> 16:31.657
<i>Why did these two take me
away from the rear palace?</i>

16:32.449 --> 16:35.661
<i>Maybe to use me to check on that guy?</i>

16:36.537 --> 16:39.456
<i>If so, nothing good will come of it.</i>

16:39.540 --> 16:40.374
Let’s go.

16:43.711 --> 16:46.797
<i>I guess running will be useless
after coming this far.</i>

16:49.842 --> 16:53.012
<i>There’s one more thing
I haven’t confirmed.</i>

16:53.679 --> 16:54.930
<i>I’m not sure, but...</i>

16:55.681 --> 16:57.182
<i>Could it be... Shisui is...?</i>

17:23.584 --> 17:24.460
We've arrived.

17:49.318 --> 17:52.613
There's a village out here?

18:05.042 --> 18:06.919
- Hot springs?
- Yeah.

18:07.002 --> 18:09.963
Otherwise, who’d build a village here?

18:10.589 --> 18:13.342
No wonder it’s so humid and warm.

18:19.056 --> 18:22.059
Are those foreigners?

18:22.851 --> 18:24.561
That paper ornament...

18:25.479 --> 18:27.815
<i>The envoy during the moon spirit.</i>

18:28.774 --> 18:30.609
<i>No... It couldn’t be.</i>

18:34.363 --> 18:37.574
Watch where you’re going!
Don’t just stand there like an idiot!

18:40.035 --> 18:41.370
<i>If this was the pleasure district,</i>

18:41.453 --> 18:44.540
<i>I'd knock this brat out!</i>

18:44.623 --> 18:45.457
- Hey!
- Ouch!

18:45.541 --> 18:48.752
You weren’t looking either, Kyou-u.

18:48.836 --> 18:50.295
Sis!

18:51.171 --> 18:53.799
Wait, it’s big sis Suirei!

18:53.882 --> 18:55.425
What’s with the outfit?

18:55.509 --> 18:57.219
It really suits you!

18:57.302 --> 18:58.303
Shut it.

18:59.179 --> 19:00.806
<i>They're acquaintances?</i>

19:00.889 --> 19:02.224
I heard

19:02.307 --> 19:05.269
I’d never see you two again...

19:05.352 --> 19:07.271
Guess nanny was lying, huh?

19:07.938 --> 19:11.358
<i>Nanny, huh? Typical rich brat.</i>

19:11.441 --> 19:14.945
Oh! Is it the festival?
So that’s why you’re back!

19:15.028 --> 19:16.321
It starts tomorrow!

19:16.405 --> 19:19.575
Yeah. Hard to believe we made it in time.

19:20.284 --> 19:21.952
Did you prepare a festival lantern?

19:22.035 --> 19:24.621
We just got back.

19:24.705 --> 19:26.165
Hope there’s something good left.

19:26.248 --> 19:28.542
Let’s check! This way, come on!

19:38.552 --> 19:42.806
<i>Is this an inn? Quite a fancy building.</i>

19:46.977 --> 19:51.398
<i>That’s one of the guards
who took the envoy.</i>

19:54.651 --> 19:57.196
Wondering why a special envoy is here,
are you?

19:57.279 --> 19:59.531
You know they were an envoy?

20:00.157 --> 20:03.410
Even after coming back to life,
I’ve had all kinds of work.

20:05.746 --> 20:08.165
No rest for the dead.

20:13.170 --> 20:16.131
Sis! Over here!

20:18.008 --> 20:19.468
Let's go, Maomao!

20:27.851 --> 20:29.645
Young Master, we found it!

20:30.270 --> 20:32.272
Is this good enough?

20:33.815 --> 20:35.108
That’s probably enough.

20:38.862 --> 20:40.614
What a nice lantern plant!

20:41.365 --> 20:42.658
Nice, right?

20:42.741 --> 20:45.619
You like it, so I made sure to find it.

20:45.702 --> 20:48.622
<i>No, didn't the maid find it?</i>

20:49.373 --> 20:50.415
Thanks.

20:51.041 --> 20:53.752
But you're not the one
who collected this, right Kyou-u?

21:04.304 --> 21:07.307
- Thanks.
- You’re welcome.

21:09.810 --> 21:11.520
Nicely done!

21:11.603 --> 21:13.772
Ow! Ow!

21:13.855 --> 21:16.942
- <i>So he can be honest sometimes, huh.</i>
- It hurts, sis!

21:17.025 --> 21:18.110
- <i>I'll call you a brat,</i>
- Quit it!

21:18.193 --> 21:19.945
<i>instead of a "damned brat."</i>

21:21.571 --> 21:23.490
<i>So the festival, huh?</i>

21:24.157 --> 21:27.119
<i>How long has it been
since we left the rear palace?</i>

21:29.204 --> 21:31.832
Lord Jinshi, the report is submitted.

21:32.624 --> 21:35.127
Near the thicket where we found the paper,

21:35.210 --> 21:37.087
we discovered an old shrine.

21:37.671 --> 21:39.339
It seems she used it as an entry point.

21:39.423 --> 21:42.301
and escaped through an abandoned waterway.

21:42.384 --> 21:46.388
Then Maomao made it
outside the rear palace?

21:46.471 --> 21:48.015
Possibly.

21:48.098 --> 21:51.893
Also, since the day Xiaomao disappeared,

21:51.977 --> 21:55.522
<i>a new eunuch has gone missing too.</i>

21:56.023 --> 21:58.900
And as for the maid named Shisui,

21:59.401 --> 22:00.944
we did not find her in the registry.

22:01.028 --> 22:02.779
She’s not registered?

22:02.863 --> 22:05.949
No. They say no such maid ever existed.

22:08.160 --> 22:10.620
Lord Jinshi! Lady Gyokuyou...

23:46.007 --> 23:48.718
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

23:57.811 --> 24:00.355
<i>The next episode is "The Lantern Plant."</i>
